    "body": "Hello @hskang-amelia,\n\nThanks for your interest in helping with the runtime and FFI implementation for Method.\n\nThe design proposed in https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/pull/818 is still under review.\n\nHowever, I believe you can start from the current design. The user-facing API is also described in the PR, which should help you better visualize the overall approach and expected Method implementation.\n\nIf possible, could you please join today's (31st Aug) weekly SCORE Communication CFT meeting? We can discuss the implementation details and any questions you may have regarding the design and implementation approach.\n\nThe meeting details are available on the SDV meeting calendar.\n\nThank you.",
